   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Introduction"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "This\n document lists the tests, which must be performed on all Power transformers as\n the manufacturers recommendations for the frequency of tests."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Information"
  },
