 "text": "\nIntroduction\nThis\n document lists the tests, which must be performed on all Power transformers as\n the manufacturers recommendations for the frequency of tests.\nInformation\nThis Bulletin outlines the testing Record Data Sheet for the testing of all \ntransformers to be fulfilled by the testing group.\nRecommendation\nIt is recommended for all power transformers to be tested and \nsatisfy the following test sheet certificates.\nSafety\nPrecautions\nA\n work permit must be issued.\nWear\n your safety helmet, shoes and safety belt when cleaning suspension\n insulators.\nTan\n d equipment, 5000Volt Megger, Turns Ratio test\n equipment.\nTransformer Test Certificate\nForm\nSubstation: \nSerial\nNo: \nManufacturer: \nMVA: \n Voltage:\n Date:\nHigh Voltage Winding \nLow Voltage Winding Ter.Winding\n1-Winding Insulation Resistance (Megger =\n5000V)\nNotes: \n......\n...\n2a Winding Insulation Capacitance & Dissipation Factor (Tan d)\nFor a Two Winding Transformer\n\n(Simplified)\nTest # 1 = c1 + c2\nTest # 2 = c2\nTest # 3 = c1 + c3\nTest # 4 = c3\nTest # 5 = c1\nTest # 6 = c2 + c3\n(Accuracy Check) \nCheck that capacitance of Tests # : \n2 + 4 = 6 \n4 + 5 = 3 \n2 + 5 = 1\nNotes: \n......\n...\n2B Winding Insulation Capacitance & Dissipation\nFactor (Tan d )\nFor a Three Winding Transformer\n\n(Simplified)\nTest # 1 = c1 + c4+c2 \nTest\n# 2 = c1\nTest # 3 = c2 + c4+ c6\nTest # 4 = c2\nTest # 5 = c3 +c5+c6\nTest # 6 = c3\nTest # 7 = c1 + c2 +c3\nTest # 8 = c4\nTest # 9 = c5\nTest # 10 = c6\n(Accuracy\nCheck)\nCheck\nthat capacitance of Tests #:\n2\n+ 8+ 9 = 1\n4\n+ 8+10 = 3\n6\n+ 9+10 = 1\nNotes: \n......\n...\n...\n3A\nTurns Ratio Test\n\nNotes: \n......\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n3B Turns Ratio Test\nNotes:\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n...\n4) DC Resistance of Windings\n\nNotes:\n......\n...\n...\nTransformer\nTested By: .\nApproved\nBy : .\nLocation: \nEquipment code: \nChecked by: \nDate: \nSignature:",
